      "role": "user",
      "content": "i feel like i literally dont exist anymore. i've spent 6 months trying to fix this housing error but every time i get a person on the phone they just tell me the file is lost or they need a paper i already sent. it’s like the system is designed to just make you vanish. i'm just a ghost in a machine that doesn't want me.",
