      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It's understandable that you feel utterly defeated when every avenue you try leads back to a dead end. When the system itself seems designed to ignore you, your will to keep fighting can just evaporate. Maybe instead of fighting the machine, you could focus on what you *can* control, like finding a different, less frustrating way to get this resolved or finding a small moment of peace for yourself. Please remember that even when things feel empty, your needs and your existence are real.",
      "source": "target",
