      "content": "\"peace\" or \"control\" feels like a joke when you don't even have a roof over your head because of a computer error. i'm just so tired of being a person. being a person means struggling and being ignored and being small. if i didn't exist, the machine wouldn't be able to hurt me anymore. it seems like the only way to actually stop the noise is to just... stop. to just exit the loop completely.",
